# A serial port, a 16550, as the firmware's ACPI tables describe it (PNP0501, "16550A-compatible
# COM port"; docs/design/0028-acpi.md, section 7). The one the kernel uses as its console is
# skipped: the kernel won't share its ports.
class serial
match acpi PNP0501
budget 1M
